# Lamp applies to an empty library; its actual replacement draw is then replaced by Laboratory Maniac (CR 121.6a, 616.1g).
[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus x3
Show and Tell
Aladdin's Lamp
Laboratory Maniac
Gitaxian Probe
[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20
[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Hand.Show and Tell.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Aladdin's Lamp)
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Hand.Laboratory Maniac.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Battlefield.Aladdin's Lamp.Activate(X: 1)
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Gitaxian Probe.Cast(Bot2)
Bot1.Modes(1)
Bot1.Replace(Aladdin's Lamp)
[Expect]
Result = Bot1 won
